            "title": "Helloes, to the Habibis",
            "summary": "Alors. This \"blog\" (or whatever you want to call it) is entirely&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-sfc-cb=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIBRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-copy-service-computed-style=\"font-family: &quot;Google Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><strong>Alors. </strong></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">This \"blog\" (or whatever you want to call it) is entirely dedicated to my opinion.</p>\n<p id=\"p-rc_87c27a3eb5cc249e-47\" data-path-to-node=\"7\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0\">I’m taking my <span style=\"background: #FF00FF; color: #39ff14; border: 3px solid #39FF14; padding: 1px 10px; font-weight: 900; font-family: sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; transform: rotate(-5deg); letter-spacing: 3px; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #000, 7px 7px 0 #39FF14; text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 #000;\">EYE <span style=\"font-size: 1.1em; vertical-align: middle;\">🧿</span></span> to profile people (<em>and normal civilians too</em>). I sit down with them and ask observational NON-boring questions instead of basic PR ones</span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2\">. </span></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Oh and I'm also dumping my notebook entries here. I'm planning on writing micro-essays on the design behind IKEA’s winding paths, consumerism, CAN Ibiza, the disappearance of newsstands on Toronto sidewalks, hotel concierges (<em>Mr. Gustave my icon</em>), organic toilet paper, Hermès Horizon’s... <em>all of it</em>.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Plus I’m an HBSc candidate so I'm also thinking of translating and dumping down info I read in dense research papers on the gut microbiome (<em>an area of personal interest</em>) into stuff you can actually read without falling asleep.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\">I know this sounds all over the place. I'll get better at writing don't worry lol.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\">Consider this your <span style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(#000 40%, transparent 41%), radial-gradient(#734212 35%, transparent 36%), linear-gradient(to right, #e0a348, #bd7e2a); background-size: 12px 12px, 12px 12px, 100% 100%; background-position: 0 0, 6px 6px, 0 0; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; font-family: 'Arial Black', 'Trebuchet MS', sans-serif; font-size: 1.4em; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -1px; text-transform: uppercase; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;\">MASTERCLASS</span> on how to become a true <strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"55\">GAZELLE DE WALLER</strong>. Pure taste and high cultural capital.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Read along. Or don't, habibi.</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image align-center\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://zuzulableue.com/media/posts/2/0704.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"240\" height=\"240\"></figure>\n</div>",
